@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100

### API process health: 200 when the API is running.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Database readiness: 200 when DynamoDB responds, otherwise 503.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Allow the existing local WebGL origin.
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/health/live
Origin: http://localhost:8080
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET

### Anonymous session metadata. facebookEnabled is false until secrets are configured.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/session

### Requires a browser session; anonymous requests return 401.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/save

### Open in the browser for real OAuth; returns 503 if credentials are absent.
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/facebook
